      { "abbr": "ਵਾਰ [N]", "gurmukhi": "ਵਾਰ", "english": "vaar; the key's rule: a raag with one vaar gets no number; raags with several use ਵਾਰ 1/2/3; the weekday bani (ਐਤ ਸੋਮ ...) is cited ਵਾਰ ੭", "source": "front_matter" },
